# BEGIN ludius-pve
# Remove with BLOCK=ludius-pve infra/monitor/homelab/remove-monitor.sh (it needs the BEGIN and END lines exactly as they are).
# Proxmox web UI behind Claustra. Public site: Claustra login, then the loopback hop below.
# The box's tailscale serve answers only its MagicDNS name as Host (anything else is a 404) and passes that Host on;
# pveproxy does not check Host. The snippet can't set header_up, so the Host rewrite lives in the hop. serve
# terminates pveproxy's self-signed TLS (https+insecure); Caddy proxies the noVNC and xterm.js WebSocket upgrades
# without extra config. PVE's own login stays on.
pve.ludius.se {
	import claustra_forward http://127.0.0.1:18453
}

http://127.0.0.1:18453 {
	bind 127.0.0.1
	reverse_proxy __BOX_TAILNET_IP__:__PVE_TS_PORT__ {
		header_up Host __BOX_DNS_NAME__:__PVE_TS_PORT__
	}
}
# END ludius-pve
